    <unit id="DisabledDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>To mark a button as disabled, add the disabled property to the Button.</source>
        <target state="translated">為按鈕添加 disabled 屬性可以將按鈕標記為禁用狀態。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
