      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="ExampleGroupShapeDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Round, circle and icon buttons keep compact actions easy to recognize.</source>
        <target state="translated">圓角、圓形和圖標按鈕可以讓緊湊操作更容易識別。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="ExampleGroupShapeTitle">
